owerful, playful, and personal. Every shade is created to help you show up exactly as you are, whether your mood is soft, fierce, elegant, wild, calm, or completely unstoppable.<\/p><p>IM BITCH is more than a beauty brand. It is a statement.<\/p><p>It is for the women who own their style, protect their energy, and never apologize for being themselves.<\/p><p>From our first shade to every product we release, we focus on beautiful colors, premium presentation, and a brand experience that feels confident, modern, and unforgettable.<\/p><p>Two sisters. One dream. A whole lot of attitude.<\/p><p>Welcome to IM BITCH.<\/p>","about_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Main_image_frame_1.png","enable_animations":false,"animation_style":"fade-left","animation_duration":800,"animation_stagger":150,"animation_easing":"linear"}},"brand_marquee_HYC6bL":{"type":"brand-marquee","blocks":{"logo_bkfKTE":{"type":"logo","settings":{"logo_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/gempages_432750572815254551-09b32a0d-a2e8-4b33-a417-0b7b1e2ad64c.svg","logo_alt":"","logo_link":""}},"logo_fgcYkH":{"type":"logo","settings":{"logo_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/gempages_432750572815254551-bfc3ae1c-53f4-471b-bff6-1eff91a8eee1.svg","logo_alt":"Vogue","logo_link":""}},"logo_mejbeA":{"type":"logo","settings":{"logo_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/gempages_432750572815254551-401a712a-a014-4895-9657-3853f98170ee.svg","logo_alt":"","logo_link":""}},"logo_iGmV37":{"type":"logo","settings":{"logo_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/gempages_432750572815254551-8cb41412-0e49-4984-b835-306a6a6aec7e.svg","logo_alt":"","logo_link":""}},"logo_kHzcdV":{"type":"logo","settings":{"logo_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/gempages_432750572815254551-4d2f2e0d-3391-4b0a-a832-4faa914ba781.svg","logo_alt":"ELLE","logo_link":""}}},"block_order":["logo_bkfKTE","logo_fgcYkH","logo_mejbeA","logo_iGmV37","logo_kHzcdV"],"name":"Brand Marquee","settings":{"bg_color":"#030407","section_height":100,"padding_top":16,"padding_bottom":16,"pad